To run the application, use the command `php -S 0.0.0.0:5000 -t public`. This will start the Lumen application on port 5000, and you can test the PDF concatenation functionality by sending a POST request to `http://localhost:5000/concatenate` with multiple PDF files in the `files` field of a multipart/form-data request.

